{
  "slug": "unstructured-foundation",
  "name": "Unstructured Foundation",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Connect sources and search processed documents with Unstructured Foundation. Provides MCP access to source setup, processing status, document search, and document retrieval.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `connect` (Connect a new source to Unstructured Foundation), `help` (Explain what Unstructured Foundation can do, including commands and example asks), `manage` (Open the Unstructured Foundation dashboard to manage connected sources), `search` (User-viewable, user-invocable guidance for searching and reading Unstructured Foundation documents), `start` (Start using Unstructured Foundation and choose the best next step)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `foundation`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install unstructured-foundation@knowledge-work-plugins` from `Unstructured-IO/unstructured-foundation-marketplace` (`plugins/foundation`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
